{"seq":1,"slug":"component-architecture","title":"ROS 2 组件架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/ros2-advanced/component-architecture","wordCount":575,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ros-2-组件架构\">ROS 2 组件架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ROS 2 的组件（Component）架构是一种将多个节点加载到同一进程中的技术，通过避免跨进程通信来显著降低消息传递延迟和 CPU 开销。在传统的 ROS 2 部署中，每个节点运行在独立进程中，节点间通过 DDS 中间件进行进程间通信（IPC）。组件化将相关节点合并到同一进程，使消息传递退化为进程内的指针传递。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[ROS 2 节点部署模型] --&gt; B[独立进程模式]&#10;    A --&gt; C[组件模式]&#10;    B --&gt; D[每节点一进程]&#10;    B --&gt; E[DDS IPC 通信]&#10;    C --&gt; F[多节点同进程]&#10;    C --&gt; G[零拷贝传递]&#10;    A --&gt; H[混合模式]&#10;    H --&gt; I[关键路径组件化]&#10;    H --&gt; J[非关键独立进程]\">graph TD\n    A[ROS 2 节点部署模型] --&gt; B[独立进程模式]\n    A --&gt; C[组件模式]\n    B --&gt; D[每节点一进程]\n    B --&gt; E[DDS IPC 通信]\n    C --&gt; F[多节点同进程]\n    C --&gt; G[零拷贝传递]\n    A --&gt; H[混合模式]\n    H --&gt; I[关键路径组件化]\n    H --&gt; J[非关键独立进程]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部署模式</th>\n<th>通信方式</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>CPU 开销</th>\n<th>隔离性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>独立进程</td>\n<td>DDS IPC</td>\n<td>高（μs-ms）</td>\n<td>高（序列化）</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>调试、模块化开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件模式</td>\n<td>进程内指针</td>\n<td>极低（ns）</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>性能关键路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合模式</td>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>生产部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"组件节点开发\">组件节点开发</h2><h3 id=\"编写组件节点\">编写组件节点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;rclcpp/rclcpp.hpp&gt;&#10;#include &lt;sensor_msgs/msg/image.hpp&gt;&#10;#include &lt;rclcpp_components/register_node_macro.hpp&gt;&#10;&#10;namespace perception {&#10;&#10;class ImageProcessor : public rclcpp::Node {&#10;public:&#10;    explicit ImageProcessor(const rclcpp::NodeOptions &amp;options)&#10;        : Node(&quot;image_processor&quot;, options) {&#10;        sub_ = create_subscription&lt;sensor_msgs::msg::Image&gt;(&#10;            &quot;camera/image_raw&quot;, rclcpp::SensorDataQoS(),&#10;            [this](sensor_msgs::msg::Image::UniquePtr msg) {&#10;                process_image(std::move(msg));&#10;            });&#10;&#10;        pub_ = create_publisher&lt;sensor_msgs::msg::Image&gt;(&#10;            &quot;camera/image_processed&quot;, rclcpp::SensorDataQoS());&#10;    }&#10;&#10;private:&#10;    void process_image(sensor_msgs::msg::Image::UniquePtr msg) {&#10;        pub_-&gt;publish(std::move(*msg));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    rclcpp::Subscription&lt;sensor_msgs::msg::Image&gt;::SharedPtr sub_;&#10;    rclcpp::Publisher&lt;sensor_msgs::msg::Image&gt;::SharedPtr pub_;&#10;};&#10;&#10;}&#10;&#10;RCLCPP_COMPONENTS_REGISTER_NODE(perception::ImageProcessor)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;rclcpp/rclcpp.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;sensor_msgs/msg/image.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;rclcpp_components/register_node_macro.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">namespace</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> perception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImageProcessor</span><span style=\"color: